/*--------------------------------------------

 Gullstrand 1 Eye — Isolated Crystalline Lens

 The full crystalline lens (anterior lens, cortex, nucleus, cortex,
 posterior lens) from the Gullstrand No. 1 relaxed eye, lifted out of
 the whole eye: bounded by aqueous in front and vitreous behind, with
 the cornea removed. A parallel beam from an axial + off-axis distant
 object is traced through the lens.

 Equivalent power of the isolated lens:      Fe  = +19.1109 D
 Front principal plane (from V1, lens):      H   = +2.0779 mm
 Back principal plane (from V4, lens):       H'  = -1.3931 mm
 Back focal distance (from V4, lens):        BFD = +68.5148 mm

----------------------------------------------*/
